#: b11374729fef4557bb004d4433f3d2d1
msgid "The RC receiver 5 V pad next to RX3 (\"+\") is also powered from USB for easy and safe configuration without having to connect the main battery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:97
#: 26aea996fe9b490f8dee4d3d6aaca01a
msgid "The RX3 pin, can be used for all ArduPilot supported single wire receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:99
#: 406c1dfec13b4a16afc3a4762d8bef91
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, use the TX3 pin also."
msgstr ""

